The afternoon time passes quickly.
I work on my computer.
I write my new software code.
Rohan also does his work.
We both are very busy.
I test my code.
The code runs perfectly.
I feel very happy.
Now it is evening.
Outside, the sun sets.
I save all my work.
I shut down my laptop.
I prepare my bag.
I look towards Rohan and wave my hand.
"Bye Rohan, see you tomorrow," I say.
"Bye Maya, take care," Rohan says.
I say bye to the rest of the team too.
Everyone smiles.
I step out of the office building.
Now I am ready to go home.
